flowchart LR
A[Request] --> B[Read-only candidate generation]
B --> C[Indivisible time + qualified therapist + compatible room]
C --> D[Final revalidation and transactional reservation]
D -->|conflict| E[Reject; no partial reservation; prior session retained]
D -->|success| F[Persist session / history / outbox]
F --> G[Worker claim and provider dispatch]
G --> H[Sent / retry / final failure]
I[Confirmation: PENDING to CONFIRMED / DECLINED / EXPIRED]
J[Cross-customer recovery requires mutual consent; workflow partial]
K[Defaults 5 attempts; 30s, 1m, 2m, 4m; SQL Server / providers unverified]
